HH.ru Job Market Analysis

Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing job postings from HH.ru using SQL. The main goal was to explore the analytics job market, 
identify current hiring trends, analyze salary ranges, and understand the skills and requirements employers expect from data 
and system analysts.

Objectives

* Analyze salary ranges for analytics-related positions.
* Identify regions with the highest number of job postings.
* Find companies with the largest number of open positions.
* Analyze the distribution of employment types and work schedules.
* Explore the distribution of experience levels (Junior, Middle, Senior).
* Compare requirements for Data Analysts and System Analysts.
* Identify the most in-demand technical and soft skills.

Tools Used

* SQL
* PostgreSQL

Key Analysis

* Salary range analysis.
* Job distribution by region.
* Analysis of top hiring companies.
* Employment type and work schedule analysis.
* Experience level distribution.
* Comparison of Data Analyst and System Analyst positions.
* Analysis of required hard and soft skills by role and experience level.

Skills Demonstrated

* Data extraction and analysis using SQL.
* Data aggregation and filtering.
* JOIN operations.
* Common Table Expressions (CTEs).
* Window functions.
* Business-oriented data analysis.
* Data-driven insights generation.

Conclusion

This project provides insights into the current analytics job market by analyzing thousands of job postings. 
The results help identify key employer requirements, salary trends, and the most valuable skills for different analytics roles
and experience levels.

